<title>UK: Quadramatic annual pretax profit up 30 pct.</title>
<headline>Quadramatic annual pretax profit up 30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		18.6		   vs   16.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  5.50		  vs    4.95</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  9.30		  vs    8.15</p>
<p> Pretax		     13.01		  vs   10.01</p>
<p> Turnover		   62.31*		 vs   46.04*</p>
<p> Interest		    0.055		 vs  0.073</p>
<p> Tax			   4.44		  vs  3.43</p>
<p> Net taxed		   8.57		  vs  6.58</p>
<p> Pay date		    February 14, 1997</p>
<p> Div registration date   January 14, 1997</p>
<p> Ex-div date		 January 6, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Quadramatic Plc makes and sells coin-handling equipment and specialised moulded products.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44-171-542 7717</p>
</text>
